insert into private.conditions (slug, condition_id, name, case_suitable, commonness, primary_clerkship, clerkships, organ_systems, triage, background) values ($rounds_kb$degenerative-nerve-diseases$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$mplus-619$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$Degenerative Nerve Diseases$rounds_kb$, false, $rounds_kb$uncommon$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$neurology$rounds_kb$, array[$rounds_kb$neurology$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$internalMedicine$rounds_kb$]::text[], array[$rounds_kb$nervous$rounds_kb$]::text[], $rounds_kb${"name": "Degenerative Nerve Diseases", "case_suitable": false, "reason": "Umbrella category of neurodegenerative conditions rather than a single diagnosis; no one patient presentation or workup.", "kind": "disease", "category": "neurodegenerative disease", "organ_systems": ["nervous"], "primary_clerkship": "neurology", "secondary_clerkships": ["internalMedicine"], "commonness": "uncommon", "settings": ["clinic"], "is_cancer": false}$rounds_kb$::jsonb, $rounds_kb$Degenerative nerve diseases affect many of your body's activities, such as balance, movement, talking, breathing, and heart function. Many of these diseases are genetic. Sometimes the cause is a medical condition such as alcoholism, a tumor, or a stroke. Other causes may include toxins, chemicals, and viruses. Sometimes the cause is unknown.
Degenerative nerve diseases include:
- Alzheimer's disease
- Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis
- Friedreich ataxia
- Huntington's disease
- Lewy body disease
- Parkinson's disease
- Spinal muscular atrophy
Degenerative nerve diseases can be serious or life-threatening. It depends on the type. Most of them have no cure. Treatments may help improve symptoms, relieve pain, and increase mobility.
MeSH definition (Neurodegenerative Diseases): Hereditary and sporadic conditions which are characterized by progressive nervous system dysfunction. These disorders are often associated with atrophy of the affected central or peripheral nervous system structures.
Also called: Neurodegenerative diseases
Related conditions (candidate look-alikes): Autonomic Nervous System Disorders, Brain Malformations, Neurologic Diseases, Neuromuscular Disorders, Restless Legs, Sleep Disorders$rounds_kb$)
