insert into private.conditions (slug, condition_id, name, case_suitable, commonness, primary_clerkship, clerkships, organ_systems, triage, background) values ($rounds_kb$overactive-bladder$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$mplus-6132$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$Overactive Bladder$rounds_kb$, true, $rounds_kb$very_common$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$familyMedicine$rounds_kb$, array[$rounds_kb$familyMedicine$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$internalMedicine$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$obgyn$rounds_kb$]::text[], array[$rounds_kb$renal$rounds_kb$]::text[], $rounds_kb${"name": "Overactive Bladder", "case_suitable": true, "reason": "Common syndrome of urgency, frequency and nocturia diagnosed clinically by history and voiding diary, with a broad differential to exclude.", "kind": "disease", "category": "lower urinary tract dysfunction", "organ_systems": ["renal"], "primary_clerkship": "familyMedicine", "secondary_clerkships": ["internalMedicine", "obgyn"], "commonness": "very_common", "settings": ["clinic"], "is_cancer": false}$rounds_kb$::jsonb, $rounds_kb$Overactive bladder is a condition in which the bladder squeezes urine out at the wrong time. You may have overactive bladder if you have two or more of these symptoms:
- You urinate eight or more times a day or two or more times at night
- You have the sudden, strong need to urinate immediately
- You leak urine after a sudden, strong urge to urinate
You also may have incontinence, a loss of bladder control. Nerve problems, too much fluid, or too much caffeine can cause it. Often the cause is unknown.
Your doctor may prescribe a medicine that can calm muscles and nerves. The medicine may come as a pill, a liquid, or a patch. The medicines can cause your eyes to become dry. They can also cause dry mouth and constipation. To deal with these effects, use eye drops to keep your eyes moist, chew sugarless gum or suck on sugarless hard candy if dry mouth bothers you, and take small sips of water throughout the day.
NIH: National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases
MeSH definition (Urinary Bladder, Overactive): Symptom of overactive detrusor muscle of the URINARY BLADDER that contracts with abnormally high frequency and urgency. Overactive bladder is characterized by the frequent feeling of needing to urinate during the day, during the night, or both. URINARY INCONTINENCE may or may not be present.
Related conditions (candidate look-alikes): Bladder Cancer, Urinary Incontinence$rounds_kb$)
