insert into private.conditions (slug, condition_id, name, case_suitable, commonness, primary_clerkship, clerkships, organ_systems, triage, background) values ($rounds_kb$peritoneal-disorders$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$mplus-5583$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$Peritoneal Disorders$rounds_kb$, false, $rounds_kb$uncommon$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$surgery$rounds_kb$, array[$rounds_kb$surgery$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$internalMedicine$rounds_kb$, $rounds_kb$emergency$rounds_kb$]::text[], array[$rounds_kb$gastrointestinal$rounds_kb$]::text[], $rounds_kb${"name": "Peritoneal Disorders", "case_suitable": false, "reason": "A broad category including peritonitis, ascites and peritoneal carcinomatosis; not a single reachable diagnosis.", "kind": "other", "category": "peritoneal disease", "organ_systems": ["gastrointestinal"], "primary_clerkship": "surgery", "secondary_clerkships": ["internalMedicine", "emergency"], "commonness": "uncommon", "settings": ["inpatient", "emergency"], "is_cancer": false}$rounds_kb$::jsonb, $rounds_kb$Your peritoneum is the tissue that lines your abdominal wall and covers most of the organs in your abdomen. A liquid, peritoneal fluid, lubricates the surface of this tissue.
Disorders of the peritoneum are not common. They include:
- Peritonitis - an inflammation of the peritoneum
- Cancer
- Complications from peritoneal dialysis
Your doctor may use imaging tests or lab tests to analyze the peritoneal fluid to diagnose the problem. Treatment of peritoneal disorders depends on the cause.
MeSH definition (Peritoneal Diseases): Pathological processes involving the PERITONEUM.
Related conditions (candidate look-alikes): Digestive Diseases, Liver Diseases, Pancreatic Diseases$rounds_kb$)
